              "3dWzNZXA8DY@625",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@627"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p03.08",
            "text": "These models are called large language models because we are living in an age of unprecedentedly huge parameter counts.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@630",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@633",
