          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s02.p04",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p04.01",
            "text": "The broader AI stack becomes clearer when the categories are nested.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p04.02",
            "text": "Artificial intelligence is the broadest umbrella, machine learning is a subset of artificial intelligence, deep learning is a subset of machine learning, and large language models are a subset of deep learning.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1104",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1107",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1109",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1111",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1113",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1115",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1118",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1120",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1122",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1125",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1127",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1130",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1485",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1487",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1490",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1492"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p04.03",
            "text": "Artificial intelligence is the broad category that includes any machine showing even remotely human-like behavior or some sort of intelligence.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1141",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1143",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1146",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1149",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1152",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1154"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p04.04",
            "text": "A rule-based chatbot can be an example of artificial intelligence without being machine learning.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1160",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1163",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1181",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1184",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1191",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1193",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1220",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1222",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1225"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p04.05",
            "text": "It is not machine learning because it does not learn from user responses and behaves the same way for different users.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1200",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1203",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1205",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1208",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1210",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1212",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1215",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1218",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1220"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p04.06",
            "text": "Machine learning consists of machines that learn and adapt based on how users interact with them.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1231",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1234",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1236",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1238"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s02.p05",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p05.01",
            "text": "Deep learning narrows the focus further.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p05.02",
            "text": "Deep learning usually involves neural networks, whereas machine learning includes neural networks and also methods that are not neural networks, such as decision trees.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1242",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1245",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1248",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1250",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1252",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1254",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1257",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1396",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1398",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1400",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1403",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1405",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1407"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p05.03",
            "text": "A decision tree used to predict heart disease from patient data is an example of machine learning but not deep learning because it does not use neural networks.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1257",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1259",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1261",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1263",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1266",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1270",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1272",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1274",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1276",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1279",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1281",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1283",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1285"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p05.04",
            "text": "A convolutional neural network for image detection is an example of deep learning because it uses a neural network to classify an input image.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1289",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1292",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1293",
