              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1370",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1374",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1376",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1378"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p05.06",
            "text": "Deep learning is therefore a subset of machine learning because machine learning includes neural network methods and also methods like decision trees that are not neural networks.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1396",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1398",
