              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1407"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p05.07",
            "text": "Large language models are then a subset of deep learning because deep learning also includes image-based work, while LLMs deal only with text.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1409",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1414",
