              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1427",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1429"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s02.p06",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p06.01",
            "text": "This also explains where generative AI sits relative to LLMs.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p06.02",
            "text": "Generative AI can be thought of as a mixture of large language models and deep learning because it handles multiple modalities such as image, sound, and video.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1435",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1437",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1439",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1441",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1444",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1446",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1450",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1451",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1454",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1456"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p06.03",
            "text": "More specifically, generative AI uses deep neural networks to create new content such as text, images, and other media, whereas LLMs deal only with text.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1458",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1461",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1463",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1466",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1469",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1472",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1474"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s02.p06.04",
            "text": "So although the terms are often confused, LLMs are a specific text-focused application within deep learning, while generative AI extends across several media types.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
